{
  "Script": "Story/MC02/Day25/World/MC02_25_00_07",
  "Entries": [
    {
      "Context": "SetPeriodText:0",
      "Original": "Let's keep moving forward!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_07_World_00000_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Huh? Is it just me, or does it seem like the Cancers have vanished?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_07_World_00001_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "We're about to come across a mountain ridge. Let's keep going.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00000_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What's that sound? Or is it a voice?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00001_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What? Did you hear something?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00002_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yukkie, did you hear like...a scream in the distance?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00003_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Now that you mention it... I've got a bad feeling about all of this.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00004_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Wherever the voice is coming from, it's got to be the origin of this anomaly.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_01064_v001_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So a boss-level Cancer really showed up?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00006_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That's certainly a possibility.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00007_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Let's keep moving carefully to avoid it.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00008_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I'll go ahead and report this to HQ.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00009_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.miniCutIn:2",
      "Original": "This is HQ. Go ahead.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00010_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So...we think a pretty strong Cancer popped up. Yukkie is comparing the data right now, so if HQ could get on that as well, that'd be great.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_25_00_03_Novel_00011_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.miniCutIn:2",
      "Original": "Understood. We'll start looking into it immediately.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
  "Inserts": []
}